file_name": "Screenshot_5.png", "id": "1077729651121598", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824594_1077729654454931_6702395722712920441_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eo_MQ5OOZRYQ7kNvwHm2kFg&_nc_oc=Adr5UhoitYccLaVC9q4tzFl8qnNC2XdGg_GQtcVfmIBlI06KQ-4EvEPdTCTT4DhBK3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6hdFa9I2zmEKKoj-C7T5DzP8CAcks_I5qD0eijh4_PjA&oe=69FDDECD"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_1.png", "id": "1252234639930239", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822897_1252234643263572_96789663655941311_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wqtxe8BiN_YQ7kNvwGHaCwP&_nc_oc=AdpVdxnugIUNc6HZdJn0nh9aOPANlcFXtNCIPNwwCFckzZX2UsVFFp6ucZV9R6O7f48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7w2KhxGvLhVY9gV9bwjGqIW5ALFl6ibTQoY7B5ngvoUQ&oe=69FE03BA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Soccer Football Game : Rematch", "keywords": ["footballGame", "Rematch", "FootballSimulator", "SoccerFootBall"], "long_description": "Get ready for an exciting football experience in Soccer Football Game: Rematch! Step onto the field \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f where every pass, tackle, and goal matters. Compete in fast-paced matches \ud83d\udd25, improve your skills \ud83c\udfaf, and enjoy balanced gameplay designed for players of all levels.\nChoose your team \ud83d\udc55, customize your players, and play with smooth, responsive controls \ud83c\udfae. Experience realistic ball movement \u26bd, dynamic AI opponents \ud83e\udd16, and gameplay mechanics that reward smart decisions and timing. Whether you prefer quick matches \u23f1\ufe0f, full tournaments \ud83c\udfc6, or online multiplayer \ud83c\udf10, there are multiple ways to play and progress.\nReplay previous matches using Rematch mode \ud83d\udd01 to refine your strategies and improve performance. Learn from each game, adjust tactics \ud83e\udde0, and aim for better results over time.\nEnjoy vibrant visuals \ud83c\udfa8, detailed stadium environments \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f, and engaging sound effects \ud83d\udd0a that enhance every moment on the pitch. Each match offers a chance to develop your skills and enjoy competitive football action.\n\u2728 Features:\n\u26bd Fast-paced matches with smooth controls\n\ud83c\udfaf Skill-based gameplay and realistic ball physics\n\ud83e\udd16 Dynamic AI with adaptive challenge\n\ud83c\udf10 Online multiplayer for real-time matches\n\ud83d\udd01 Rematch mode to replay and improve\n\ud83c\udfc6 Tournament and quick play options\n\ud83c\udfa8 Detailed visuals and immersive sound\nStep onto the pitch, play your way, and enjoy every match in Soccer Football Game: Rematch!", "short_description": "\u26bd Step back onto the pitch in Soccer Football Game: Rematch and experience fast-paced football action \ud83d\udd25. Compete in dynamic matches, outplay rivals \ud83c\udfaf, and refine your skills with every play. Control the ball, make smart passes \ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f, and take precise shots \ud83e\udd45 to turn the game in your favor. Each match is a new opportunity to improve, compete, and enjoy the excitement of football in a competitive environment \ud83c\udfae."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhub-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Horizon Hub", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhubcom/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supp